#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Our bread is baked every morning, grilled over the flame and rubbed with "
"garlic, then topped with ripe tomatoes marinated in olive oil and torn "
"basil. A Tuscan farmhouse classic."
msgstr ""
"Nuestro pan se hornea cada mañana, se tuesta a la llama y se frota con ajo; "
"luego lo cubrimos con tomates maduros marinados en aceite de oliva y "
"albahaca fresca. Un clásico de las granjas de la Toscana."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Prime beef tenderloin, chilled and sliced paper-thin, dressed with lemon, "
"peppery rocket, aged Parmigiano Reggiano and a few drops of black truffle "
"oil. The dish was created in Venice in 1950."
msgstr ""
"Solomillo de res de primera, frío y cortado finísimo, aliñado con limón, "
"rúcula, Parmigiano Reggiano añejo y unas gotas de aceite de trufa negra. "
"Este plato nació en Venecia en 1950."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Sicily’s favourite street food: saffron risotto shaped by hand around a "
"heart of melting mozzarella, rolled in breadcrumbs and fried until golden."
msgstr ""
"La comida callejera favorita de Sicilia: risotto de azafrán formado a mano "
"alrededor de un corazón de mozzarella fundida, rebozado en pan rallado y "
"frito hasta dorarse."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"A tribute to the island of Capri in the colours of the Italian flag: creamy "
"buffalo mozzarella from Campania, heirloom tomatoes and basil, finished with"
" pearls of aged balsamic from Modena."
msgstr ""
"Un homenaje a la isla de Capri con los colores de la bandera italiana: "
"mozzarella de búfala de Campania, tomates tradicionales y albahaca, con "
"perlas de balsámico añejo de Módena."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"A sharing board for the table: prosciutto di Parma, salame and mortadella, "
"aged pecorino and gorgonzola, marinated olives and crisp grissini."
msgstr ""
"Una tabla para compartir: prosciutto di Parma, salame y mortadela, pecorino "
"añejo y gorgonzola, aceitunas marinadas y grissini crujientes."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Tender squid dusted in seasoned flour and fried in seconds so it stays light"
" and crisp, served the Neapolitan way with lemon and a garlicky lemon aioli."
msgstr ""
"Calamar tierno pasado por harina sazonada y frito en segundos para que quede"
" ligero y crujiente, servido al estilo napolitano con limón y alioli de "
"limón."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Our ragù simmers for four hours with beef, pork, vegetables, red wine and a "
"splash of milk, just like in Bologna. Tossed with egg tagliatelle rolled by "
"hand every morning."
msgstr ""
"Nuestro ragú se cocina cuatro horas con res, cerdo, verduras, vino tinto y "
"un chorrito de leche, como en Bolonia. Lo servimos con tagliatelle de huevo "
"hechos a mano cada mañana."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Arborio rice stirred slowly with white wine and vegetable stock, finished "
"with butter, Parmigiano and shavings of black truffle. Patience in a bowl."
msgstr ""
"Arroz arborio removido lentamente con vino blanco y caldo de verduras, "
"terminado con mantequilla, Parmigiano y láminas de trufa negra. Paciencia en"
" un plato."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Mediterranean sea bass grilled skin-side down until crisp, with lemon butter"
" and fennel roasted until sweet and caramelised."
msgstr ""
"Lubina mediterránea a la parrilla por el lado de la piel hasta que queda "
"crujiente, con mantequilla de limón e hinojo asado hasta caramelizarse."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Chicken breast pounded thin, breaded and pan-fried, then baked under tomato "
"sauce, mozzarella and Parmigiano until bubbling. Comfort food from southern "
"Italy."
msgstr ""
"Pechuga de pollo aplanada, empanizada y dorada, luego horneada con salsa de "
"tomate, mozzarella y Parmigiano hasta gratinar. Comida reconfortante del sur"
" de Italia."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Veal shank braised slowly in white wine and vegetables until it falls from "
"the bone, served with saffron risotto and a fresh gremolata of lemon zest, "
"parsley and garlic."
msgstr ""
"Jarrete de ternera estofado lentamente en vino blanco y verduras hasta que "
"se desprende del hueso, con risotto de azafrán y gremolata fresca de limón, "
"perejil y ajo."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Linguine tossed with clams, mussels, prawns and squid in white wine, garlic,"
" chilli and parsley: the taste of a summer evening on the Amalfi coast."
msgstr ""
"Linguine con almejas, mejillones, camarones y calamares en vino blanco, ajo,"
" guindilla y perejil: el sabor de una tarde de verano en la costa de Amalfi."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Savoiardi biscuits dipped in fresh espresso, layered with whipped "
"mascarpone, rested overnight and dusted with cocoa. Its name means “pick me "
"up”."
msgstr ""
"Bizcochos savoiardi mojados en espresso, en capas con crema de mascarpone, "
"reposados toda la noche y espolvoreados con cacao. Su nombre significa "
"“levántame el ánimo”."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"“Cooked cream” from Piedmont: cream gently set with real vanilla, with a "
"sharp coulis of wild berries."
msgstr ""
"“Nata cocida” del Piamonte: crema cuajada suavemente con vainilla natural, "
"con un coulis ácido de frutos rojos."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Crisp pastry tubes filled to order, so they never go soft, with sweet "
"ricotta, candied orange and a sprinkle of pistachio."
msgstr ""
"Canutillos crujientes rellenos al momento, para que nunca se ablanden, con "
"ricotta dulce, naranja confitada y un toque de pistacho."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Simple and perfect: a scoop of vanilla gelato “drowned” at the table in a "
"shot of hot espresso."
msgstr ""
"Sencillo y perfecto: una bola de helado de vainilla “ahogada” en la mesa con"
" un espresso caliente."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Born by happy accident in Capri when a baker forgot the flour: a rich, fudgy"
" cake of dark chocolate and ground almonds."
msgstr ""
"Nació por un feliz accidente en Capri, cuando un pastelero olvidó la harina:"
" una torta densa y jugosa de chocolate negro y almendra molida."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Three scoops from our daily selection, churned in small batches. Ask for "
"today’s flavours; pistachio and stracciatella are guest favourites."
msgstr ""
"Tres bolas de nuestra selección del día, hechas en pequeñas tandas. Pregunta"
" por los sabores de hoy; el pistacho y la stracciatella son los favoritos."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Light, airy Ligurian focaccia, dimpled by hand, soaked with olive oil and "
"baked with rosemary and sea salt."
msgstr ""
"Focaccia ligur ligera y esponjosa, marcada a mano, bañada en aceite de oliva"
" y horneada con romero y sal marina."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Potato wedges roasted until crisp, then tossed with truffle salt and fresh "
"herbs."
msgstr ""
"Gajos de papa asados hasta quedar crujientes, con sal de trufa y hierbas "
"frescas."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Courgette, aubergine, peppers and red onion, chargrilled and dressed with "
"olive oil, garlic and fresh herbs."
msgstr ""
"Calabacín, berenjena, pimientos y cebolla morada a la brasa, aliñados con "
"aceite de oliva, ajo y hierbas frescas."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Golden cornmeal cooked slowly and finished with butter and Parmigiano, a "
"northern Italian classic."
msgstr ""
"Harina de maíz cocinada lentamente y terminada con mantequilla y Parmigiano,"
" un clásico del norte de Italia."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Mushrooms sautéed in olive oil with garlic and parsley. “Trifolati” means "
"cooked the way you would cook truffles."
msgstr ""
"Champiñones salteados en aceite de oliva con ajo y perejil. “Trifolati” "
"significa cocinados como se cocina la trufa."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"A basket of our breads baked that morning, with extra virgin olive oil and "
"aged balsamic for dipping."
msgstr ""
"Una cesta de nuestros panes horneados esa misma mañana, con aceite de oliva "
"virgen extra y balsámico añejo para mojar."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"From the hills of Valdobbiadene in the Veneto: fine bubbles with notes of "
"green apple and white flowers. The perfect start to a meal."
msgstr ""
"De las colinas de Valdobbiadene, en el Véneto: burbuja fina con notas de "
"manzana verde y flores blancas. El comienzo perfecto."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Fresh and dry, with hints of pear and citrus. A lovely match for seafood and"
" light pasta."
msgstr ""
"Fresco y seco, con notas de pera y cítricos. Ideal con mariscos y pastas "
"ligeras."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Sangiovese from the heart of Tuscany, aged at least two years: cherry, "
"leather and spice. Made for our ragù and grilled meats."
msgstr ""
"Sangiovese del corazón de la Toscana, con al menos dos años de crianza: "
"cereza, cuero y especias. Hecho para nuestro ragú y las carnes a la "
"parrilla."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Nebbiolo from Piedmont, aged at least three years. Powerful and elegant, "
"with notes of roses and dark cherry."
msgstr ""
"Nebbiolo del Piamonte, con al menos tres años de crianza. Potente y "
"elegante, con notas de rosas y cereza negra."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"A Sicilian herbal liqueur made since 1868, bittersweet with orange, "
"liquorice and herbs. Served after dinner."
msgstr ""
"Licor siciliano de hierbas elaborado desde 1868, agridulce, con naranja, "
"regaliz y hierbas. Se sirve después de cenar."

#: pages/content.py
msgid ""
"Made by steeping Sorrento lemon peel in alcohol and sugar. Served ice-cold "
"to finish the meal."
msgstr ""
"Elaborado macerando cáscara de limón de Sorrento en alcohol y azúcar. Se "
"sirve muy frío para terminar la comida."

